  "source_behavior": [
    "No command interface requests; state-interface reads and ROS publication.",
    "All available interfaces if joints or interfaces is empty; otherwise their configured cross-product.",
    "Non-DOUBLE interfaces are ignored; custom mapping, conditional URDF filtering and zero-valued extra joints are supported.",
    "Optional failed reads preserve old values; never-read movement-state values may remain NaN.",
    "JointState and optional DynamicJointState publication attempts are source behavior, not measured success."
  ],
